# Break every call onto its own line

Full rule: [`docs/standards/documentation.md`](../../docs/standards/documentation.md)
(*Break every call onto its own line*).

- No call is packed onto one line with another.
- Every chained step gets its own line.
- Every nested constructor gets its own line and its own indent level.
- Option bags with more than one key get one key per line.
- Applies to source, tests, examples, doc comments, guides, handoffs, and chat replies.

``` ts
// bad
.add(Hyperlink.group("admin").add(reset))
```

``` ts
// good
.add(
  Hyperlink.group("admin")
    .add(reset)
)
```
